 using the federal methodology and/or your institution's own standards. 
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 Need-based aid: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 
College-funded or college-administered award from institutional, state, federal, or other sources for which a student must have financial need to qualify. This includes both institutional and non}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid5141231 -}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 institutional student aid (grants, jobs, and loans).
