 aid: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 Scholarships and grants from institutional, state, federal, or other sources for which a student must have financial need to qualify.
\par 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 Need-based self-help aid: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 
Loans and jobs from institutional, state, federal, or other sources for which a student must demonstrate financial need to qualify.
