\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 Non-need-based }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid10297048\charrsid15034624 scholarship or grant}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 
 aid: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 Scholarships and grants, gifts, or merit-based aid from 
institutional, state, federal, or other sources (including unrestricted funds or gifts and endowment income) awarded solely on the basis of academic achievement, merit, or any other non-need-based reason. When reporting questions H1 and H2, non-need-based
 aid that is used to meet need should be counted as need-based aid. 
\par 
